  "editorial": {
    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "The fixed response after the Gospel. LAUS is nominative in a nominal formula, TIBI dative and CHRISTE vocative. The 1962 Ritus servandus assigns the response to the minister at low Mass. De musica sacra n. 31 a names it among the people's first-degree responses at low Mass, but n. 25 a does not include it in the corresponding list for sung Mass.",
